-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  lex_strings_err_print_prefix.pcpp - break step of lex_strings.pcpp:
  printing a u8 string, whose C++ type has no std::formatter (SM0425: the
  message names the argument as written)

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\lex_strings_err_print_prefix.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\lex_strings_err_print_prefix.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
*******************************************************************************/

module exe lex_strings_err_print_prefix;

begin
  println("{}", u8"abc"); // ERROR SM0425@17: 'u8"abc"' cannot be printed
end.
